Package: pqview
Title: Fast, Serverless Data Frame Viewer in a Single HTML File
Version: 0.12.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Joseph", "Miller", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jossammil@gmail.com"),
    person("Hyperparam", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "hyparquet and hyparquet-writer JavaScript libraries"),
    person("Arjun", "Barrett", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "fflate JavaScript library")
  )
Description: Browse a data frame or parquet file in the browser without a
    server. The data is embedded as compressed parquet inside one HTML file
    and read client-side, with a column picker, per-column filters (including
    regular expressions and inverted "everything but" filters), a SQL WHERE
    query bar, sorting, number formats, pinned columns, a row detail panel,
    global search, summary statistics, grouped counts, saved views and
    export to CSV, Excel, R data and parquet.
